September application-created volume is broadly aligned between the legacy ACQ Billing output and NCMI: 129,931 vs 128,848, a variance of -1,083 (-0.83%).


SELECT
    131178 AS LEGACY_DECISION_VOLUME,

    SUM(COALESCE(APPLICATION_COUNT, 0)) AS NCMI_DECISION_VOLUME,

    SUM(COALESCE(APPLICATION_COUNT, 0)) - 131178 AS DIFFERENCE,

    ROUND(
        (
            SUM(COALESCE(APPLICATION_COUNT, 0)) - 131178
        ) * 100.0 / 131178,
        2
    ) AS VARIANCE_PCT

FROM BDP_UK_CARDS.FACT_CARD_AGGREGATOR_APPLICATION_SUMMARY

WHERE APPLICATION_DECISION_DATE >= DATE '2026-09-01'
  AND APPLICATION_DECISION_DATE <  DATE '2026-10-01';